## API reference

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title:` / `artist:` / `album:` | `String` | - | Track title and the "artist - album" line. |
| `cover:` / `cover_alt:` | `String` | - / "Album cover" | Cover art; a music tile without one. |
| `duration:` / `position:` | `Integer` | - / `0` | Track length and starting position, in seconds. |
| `playing:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Start playing. |
| `favorite:` / `shuffle:` / `repeat:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Starting state of the toggles. |
| `src:` | `String` | - | Audio URL; without it the block runs a demo clock. |
